#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:2
msgid "Hf3fs"
msgstr "Hf3fs"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:4
msgid ""
"An L2 adapter backed by the native C++ 3FS connector. Uses the 3FS Usrbio"
" API for high-performance distributed KV cache storage."
msgstr "一个由原生 C++ 3FS 连接器支持的 L2 适配器。使用 3FS Usrbio API 进行高性能分布式 KV Cache 存储。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:7
msgid "**Prerequisites**"
msgstr "**先决条件**"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:9
msgid ""
"**3FS Usrbio** 3FS Usrbio header (``hf3fs_usrbio.h``) and lib "
"(``libhf3fs_api_shared.so``) are required when compiling the LMCache "
"hf3fs extension.  We recommend installing them from source:"
msgstr "**3FS Usrbio** 编译 LMCache hf3fs 扩展时需要 3FS Usrbio 头文件 (``hf3fs_usrbio.h``) 和库 (``libhf3fs_api_shared.so``)。我们建议从源代码安装它们："

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:24
msgid ""
"See `3FS Build <https://github.com/deepseek-ai/3FS/blob/main/README.md"
"#build-3fs>`_ for the full build instructions."
msgstr "请参阅 `3FS Build <https://github.com/deepseek-ai/3FS/blob/main/README.md#build-3fs>`_ 获取完整的构建说明。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:27
msgid ""
"If 3FS Usrbio header or lib are not installed in the system path (e.g., "
"``/usr/local/include``, ``/usr/local/lib``), you must set "
"``HF3FS_INCLUDE_DIR`` and ``HF3FS_LIB_DIR`` to point to them explicitly:"
msgstr "如果 3FS Usrbio 头文件或库未安装在系统路径中（例如，``/usr/local/include``，``/usr/local/lib``），您必须将 ``HF3FS_INCLUDE_DIR`` 和 ``HF3FS_LIB_DIR`` 显式设置为指向它们："

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:36
msgid "**libabsl-dev**"
msgstr "**libabsl-dev**"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:38
msgid ""
"The connector uses Abseil containers (``sharded_flat_hash_map``, "
"``flat_hash_map``) from the system library.  On Debian/Ubuntu:"
msgstr "连接器使用系统库中的 Abseil 容器（``sharded_flat_hash_map``、``flat_hash_map``）。在 Debian/Ubuntu 上："

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:46
msgid "**Build**"
msgstr "**构建**"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:48
msgid ""
"The LMCache 3FS extension is **not** built by default.  You must "
"explicitly enable it:"
msgstr "LMCache 3FS 扩展默认**未**构建。您必须显式启用它："

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:55
msgid "The **BUILD_HF3FS** environment variable controls compilation:"
msgstr "**BUILD_HF3FS** 环境变量控制编译："

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:57
msgid "``BUILD_HF3FS=1``: Enable build 3FS C++ extension."
msgstr "``BUILD_HF3FS=1``: 启用构建 3FS C++ 扩展。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:58
msgid ""
"``BUILD_HF3FS=0``: Force disable (highest priority), even if "
"``HF3FS_INCLUDE_DIR`` is set."
msgstr "``BUILD_HF3FS=0``: 强制禁用（优先级最高），即使 ``HF3FS_INCLUDE_DIR`` 已设置。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:60
msgid ""
"**Not set**: Falls back to checking ``HF3FS_INCLUDE_DIR``. If "
"``HF3FS_INCLUDE_DIR`` is also unset, the 3FS extension is skipped."
msgstr "**未设置**：回退到检查 ``HF3FS_INCLUDE_DIR``。如果 ``HF3FS_INCLUDE_DIR`` 也未设置，则跳过 3FS 扩展。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:63
msgid "**LMCache-Specific Fields**"
msgstr "**LMCache 特定字段**"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:65
msgid "``num_workers`` (int, default ``4``): C++ worker threads for I/O."
msgstr "``num_workers`` (int, 默认 ``4``): 用于 I/O 的 C++ 工作线程。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:66
msgid ""
"``per_op_workers`` (``dict[str, int]``, optional): A dict mapping lane "
"keys to dedicated worker thread counts.  Supported keys:"
msgstr "``per_op_workers`` (``dict[str, int]``, 可选): 一个字典，将车道键映射到专用工作线程计数。 支持的键："

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:69
msgid "``\"lookup\"`` — threads for ``EXISTS`` operations."
msgstr "``\"lookup\"`` — 用于 ``EXISTS`` 操作的线程。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:70
msgid "``\"retrieve\"`` — threads for ``GET``/load operations."
msgstr "``\"retrieve\"`` — 处理 ``GET``/加载操作的线程。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:71
msgid "``\"store\"`` — threads for ``SET``/put operations."
msgstr "``\"store\"`` — 用于 ``SET``/放置操作的线程。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:72
msgid "``\"delete\"`` — threads for ``DELETE`` operations."
msgstr "``\"delete\"`` — 用于 ``DELETE`` 操作的线程。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:74
msgid ""
"Operations whose lane key is **not** present in the dict use the shared "
"``num_workers`` pool.  There is no requirement to set all keys — you can "
"configure only the lanes that need dedicated pools."
msgstr "不在字典中的操作通道键使用共享的 ``num_workers`` 池。没有必要设置所有键 — 您可以仅配置需要专用池的通道。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:78
msgid "**HF3FS Fields**"
msgstr "**HF3FS 字段**"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:80
msgid "``mount_point`` (str, required): 3FS mount point directory."
msgstr "``mount_point``（字符串，必需）：3FS 挂载点目录。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:81
msgid ""
"``base_paths`` (str, required): Comma-separated subdirectories under "
"``mount_point``."
msgstr "``base_paths`` (str, required): 以逗号分隔的 ``mount_point`` 下的子目录。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:83
msgid ""
"``ior_entries`` (int, default ``256``, range ``[128, 1024]``): Max "
"concurrent requests per Ior."
msgstr "``ior_entries`` (int, 默认 ``256``, 范围 ``[128, 1024]``): 每个 Ior 的最大并发请求数。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:85
msgid ""
"``io_depth`` (int, default ``0``, range ``[-128, 128]``): Batch control "
"parameter."
msgstr "``io_depth`` (int, default ``0``, range ``[-128, 128]``): 批量控制参数。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:87
msgid "``numa_id`` (int, default ``-1``): NUMA node ID (``-1`` = current node)."
msgstr "``numa_id`` (int, default ``-1``): NUMA 节点 ID (``-1`` = 当前节点)。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:88
msgid ""
"``iov_size`` (int, default ``209715200`` (200 MB), range ``[104857600, "
"2147483648]``): Per-thread I/O buffer in bytes."
msgstr "``iov_size`` (int, default ``209715200`` (200 MB), range ``[104857600, 2147483648]``): 每个线程的 I/O 缓冲区大小（以字节为单位）。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:90
msgid ""
"``enable_key_buffer`` (bool, default ``True``): Enable the in-memory key "
"buffer for accelerated exists lookups.  When enabled, exist lookups "
"respond from a hash set instead of issuing remote 3FS metadata calls. "
"This dramatically reduces lookup latency."
msgstr "``enable_key_buffer`` (bool, default ``True``): 启用内存中的键缓冲区以加速存在查找。当启用时，存在查找将从哈希集合中响应，而不是发出远程 3FS 元数据调用。这大大减少了查找延迟。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:95
msgid "**Configuration Example**"
msgstr "**配置示例**"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:117
msgid "**In-Memory Key Buffer**"
msgstr "**内存键缓冲区**"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:119
msgid ""
"When ``enable_key_buffer`` is ``True`` (the default), the connector "
"maintains an in-memory cache of all key filenames. Lookup operations "
"respond from the cache instead of issuing remote 3FS metadata calls. This"
" dramatically reduces lookup latency."
msgstr "当 ``enable_key_buffer`` 为 ``True``（默认值）时，连接器会维护一个所有键文件名的内存缓存。查找操作会从缓存中响应，而不是发出远程 3FS 元数据调用。这大大减少了查找延迟。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:123
msgid "**Trade-offs**"
msgstr "**权衡**"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:124
msgid ""
"**Enable** for workloads with many concurrent lookups (prefetch,batch "
"exists)."
msgstr "**启用** 以支持具有多个并发查找的工作负载（预取，批量存在）。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:125
msgid "The latency savings outweigh the memory cost."
msgstr "延迟节省超过了内存成本。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:126
msgid "**Disable**  when memory is constrained."
msgstr "**禁用** 当内存受限时。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:128
msgid "To disable the buffer cache:"
msgstr "要禁用缓冲区缓存："

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:144
msgid "**Unit Tests**"
msgstr "**单元测试**"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:146
msgid ""
"The hf3fs tests are gated on 3FS extension availability and 3FS storage "
"cluster accessibility: - 3FS C++ extension missing → config tests only - "
"3FS C++ extension present and 3FS storage cluster available → full test "
"suite"
msgstr "hf3fs 测试依赖于 3FS 扩展的可用性和 3FS 存储集群的可访问性：- 3FS C++ 扩展缺失 → 仅配置测试 - 3FS C++ 扩展存在且 3FS 存储集群可用 → 完整测试套件"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/hf3fs.rst:151
msgid ""
"To run the full test suite, set the **HF3FS_MOUNT_POINT** environment "
"variable to the mount point directory of a real 3FS storage cluster:"
msgstr "要运行完整的测试套件，请将 **HF3FS_MOUNT_POINT** 环境变量设置为真实 3FS 存储集群的挂载点目录："

